Select and transform the OpenBSD backend, launching sandboxed commands
through the codex-openbsd-sandbox helper.

The helper path is resolved with getexecpath(3) (OpenBSD 8.0) instead of
std::env::current_exe(), which is best-effort on OpenBSD and reports argv[0].

